   There are many ways to open the drawbridge.

- Spell of Knock.
- Wand of opening.
- Play an instrument. (Mastermind. To get you started try playing abcde on
an instrument). Sometimes your god will give you the notes.
- Zap the bridge with a wand of striking and freeze the moat. 
- If you can levitate you can try going around the back and unlocking the 
door.

 There other ways, but if you have made it down to the castle level you 
probably have the tools to implement one of these schemes.

